    "status": "adopted",
    "instruction_text": "Revoked May 2018. See People v. Sanchez (2016) 63 Cal.4th 665, 684\n[204 Cal.Rptr.3d 102, 374 P.3d 320] and Conservatorship of K.W. (2017)\n13 Cal.App.5th 1274, 1281 [221 Cal.Rptr.3d 622].",
